><li>Spacious<\/li><li>Safe and Secure<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/playpen_2.webp","image_width":500,"subtitle":"NO TOOLS REQUIRED","title":"INSTANT FUN","text":"<p>Experience the joy of playtime without delays. The Dwinguler & Baby Care Playpens are design to ensure that setup is a breeze, allowing your child to explore, play, and learn in no time.<br\/><br\/>When playtime concludes, disassembling is equally quick and stress-free, giving you more quality moments with your little one.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"background-image-text":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"Impressive","title":"About your brand","text":"<p>Pair large text with a full-width image to draw attention to an important detail of your brand or product line.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Simple Installation"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>In four simple and fast steps, you can have your surface fully installed in minutes or less.<\/p><p><strong>Getting Started<\/strong><\/p><p>The panels have two sides with female PowerLocks, and two sides with male PowerLocks. All tiles on any given installation should always have the female PowerLocks going in the same direction.<\/p><p><strong>Step One<\/strong><\/p><p>Begin the installation by laying down your first panel in any one corner and pointing the female PowerLocks in the two directions that additional panels are to be added.<\/p><p><strong>Step Two<\/strong><\/p><p>Place the next panel so that the male PowerLock line up over the top of the female loops on the first panel. It's important to make sure that the female PowerLocks are facing exactly the same direction as the first panel.<\/p><p><strong>Step Three<\/strong><\/p><p>Gently step along the joint of the two panels. You will hear and feel the PowerLocks snap into place as you go.<\/p><p><strong>Step Four<\/strong><\/p><p>Once the two panels are joined, repeat steps one through three remembering to keep the female PowerLocks aligned until your floor is complete. That's all there is to this easy-to-install flooring!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonial_3i4PXc":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p><strong>Love how quickly it was delivered<\/strong>. <br\/>Prompt and on time. It's quite large in size so you can have more play room for you baby. Love the colour I got (Blue & White). Easy to assemble as well.<\/p>","author":"Luyen N.","author_info":"Verified Buyer"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2","testimonial_3i4PXc"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"featured_video_EW3xMV":{"type":"featured-video","settings":{"title":"HASSLE-FREE ASSEMBLY","video_url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=yRREi2iE-MU","divider":false}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"12ee58e8-5133-4e52-a73b-887b18d27f7f":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"ROLL OUT AND LAY DOWN","title":"HASSLE-FREE INSTALL","text":"<p>Incredibly easy to use, the floor defenders unlike some other garage containments mats come ready to use. The single piece construction allows you to simply roll the mat out and lay it on your floor.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ezgif.com-gif-maker_8.gif","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"f220664d-cc7b-4aea-a660-b60af2d6dd55":{"type":"featured-collection","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Featured collection","home_featured_products":"garage-flooring","per_row":4,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}},"featured_collection_e4NXyw":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"PLAYMATS TO GO WITH YOUR PLAYPEN","home_featured_products":"baby-play-mats","per_row":4,"rows":4,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":true,"divider":false}},"168078895274d4618a":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"84012a34-7866-4c74-b4f7-16f370ff2d45":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["84012a34-7866-4c74-b4f7-16f370ff2d45"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":tru